        "en": "What does وَ do in a number?"
      },
      "back": {
        "ar": "",
        "en": "It means 'and'. Use it between the unit and the ten in numbers such as 26 and 53, and between the larger parts of a combined number."
      },
      "translit": "wa",
      "tags": [
        "combined"
      ],
      "source": "p. 130"
    },
